WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:09.100
Frameworks lists the rules you answer to and how much the installed packs cover.

2
00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:13.699
Show coverage lays out every requirement against every system.

3
00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:23.354
Systems are columns. A mark in a cell says whether that requirement is proven, attested, estimated, out of date or failing.

4
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:27.441
When the grid is ready, export an auditor pack for the framework.
